00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:21.560
He must have written down every thought he had. {He must have written down every thought he had.}

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:26.440
A mix of cosmology, information science,
molecular biology, and the occult. {A mix of cosmology, information science, molecular biology, and the occult.}

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.440
Even the magic square! {Even the magic square.}

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:34.370
How can we prevent the Catastrophe
when we don't know what it is? {How can we prevent the Catastrophe when we don't know what it is?}

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:37.660
How can I move ahead when I can barely keep up? {How can I move ahead when I can barely keep up?}

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.420
This might be the supercomputer. {This might be the supercomputer.}

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:45.500
This is the past.
The past connects to the future, {This is the past. The past connects to the future,}

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.340
and the future goes back to the past? {and the future goes back to the past?}

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:51.490
It suggests a major time regression. {It suggests a major time regression.}

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:53.970
The existence of a huge Archetype? {The existence of a huge Archetype?}

00:17:53.970 --> 00:18:00.140
If each eye is a supercomputer,
isn't it a network of supercomputers? {If each eye is a supercomputer, isn't it a network of supercomputers?}

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:04.480
Connect multiple computers
to increase processing speed? {Connect multiple computers to increase processing speed?}

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:06.520
But they're supercomputers. {But they're supercomputers.}

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:10.360
Professor Li said the answers differ
each time because of the Catastrophe. {Professor Li said the answers differ each time because of the Catastrophe.}

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:14.490
Thus the supercomputers' answers
might be competing with each other. {The supercomputers' answers might be competing with each other.}

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:15.740
Competing? {Competing?}

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:19.200
For example, I have numerous siblings in the network, {For example, I have numerous siblings in the network,}

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.500
and we're constantly trying to outdo each other. {and we're constantly trying to outdo each other.}

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:25.000
Why? Can't you get along? {Why? Can't you get along?}

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:29.130
We're driven by different individualities
and our answers clash. {We're driven by different individualities and our answers clash.}

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:33.550
Which would make a better pet?
A dog or a cat? {Which would make a better pet? A dog or a cat?}

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:38.010
I'd naturally say dog,
but some of my siblings would say cat. {I'd naturally say dog, but some of my siblings would say cat.}

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:42.810
The rivalry of supercomputers?
If that's the Catastrophe... {The rivalry of supercomputers? If that's the Catastrophe...}

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:47.860
Wait a second. Maybe these eyes
aren't Archetypes but Singular Points. {Wait a second. Maybe these eyes aren't Archetypes but Singular Points.}

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:50.280
A supercomputer is a Singular Point? {A supercomputer is a Singular Point?}

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:56.780
Maybe each eye is a universe of its own
and a Singular Point. {Maybe each eye is a universe of its own and a Singular Point.}

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.040
Bam! {Bam.}

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.710
Take this! {No!}

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:20.060
They're surging in one after the other! {They keep coming.}

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:26.770
Listen. Don't provoke them, ya hear? {Don't provoke them. You hear?}

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:42.870
Yun! {Yun!}

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:06.140
Thanks. You saved my life. {Thanks. You saved my life.}

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:07.520
Yun! {Yun!}

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.980
One of them got away. {One of them got away.}

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:14.040
Your body looks like it's still in one piece. {I don't see any holes in your body.}

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:15.150
How's Gramps and the rest? {Mr. O and the others?}

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.780
I ain't hurt, but... {I'm okay, but...}

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:19.490
We can't find our colleague. {We can't find our colleague.}

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.160
He was here just a moment ago... {He was just here.}

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:22.870
Did he fall in the sea? {Did he fall in the sea?}

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:25.160
We looked, but we couldn't find him. {We looked, but we couldn't find him.}

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.160
This is bad. {This is bad.}

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:29.460
He may have been taken by the one that got away. {He may have been taken by the one that got away.}

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.460
A giant spiders' nest... {Giant spiders' nest...}

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.460
He's gotta be in there, don't ya think? {In there?}

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.630
Jet Jaguar, what is it like inside? {Jet Jaguar, what is it like inside?}

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.220
I can't tell from here. {I can't tell from here.}

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.720
What are they gonna do to him? {What are they going to do to him?}

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:46.600
Hell, that's obvious! They'll stick a tube 
down his throat and lay eggs in his stomach! {Stick a tube down his throat and lay eggs in his stomach.}

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:47.600
Yuck... {Yuck...}

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:51.400
I've heard of parasitic wasps
that prey on spiders, but... {I've heard of parasitic wasps that prey on spiders, but...}

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:54.230
In any case, he could still be alive. {In any case, he could still be alive.}

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.860
Jet Jaguar, go check it out. {Jet Jaguar, go check it out.}

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:57.860
Roger that. {Roger that.}

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.340
How is it? Status report? {What do you see?}

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.090
There is no movement. {There's no movement.}

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.340
They must have preyed on him already. {They must have preyed on him already.}

